      est: "1 B notifications/day ≈ 12 k/s average, 100 k/s peaks (campaigns). Third-party provider limits are the real constraint.",
      api: "`POST /notify {userId|segment, template, data, channels, priority, idempotencyKey, sendAt?}` · `GET /notifications/{id}`.\n**Stores:** preferences + device tokens (KV), templates, notification log (wide-column), scheduled jobs.",
