      deep: "**Reliability:** persist then enqueue (outbox); retries with backoff; DLQ; idempotency key per (notification, channel, device).\n**Priority isolation:** separate queues/worker pools so marketing floods cannot delay OTPs.\n**Provider failover:** circuit breakers, secondary providers, per-provider rate limiting.\n**Fan-out for segments:** expand a campaign into per-user jobs in batches; throttle.\n**User experience:** quiet hours, frequency caps, channel fallback (push → SMS), collapse keys.\n**Token hygiene:** remove invalid device tokens on provider feedback.",
